{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "47c59132-27ac-8595-84ef-c8d295f4c4eb",
  "created_at": "2025-12-17T14:38:09-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gloria Salazar",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:36:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:36:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is this the Registry? The motor vehicles?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:36:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No ma'am, this is the Newport City Clerk at City Hall. The Registry of Motor Vehicles is a state office, so it's a different number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:36:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I dialed what was on the paper. I figured it was the same thing. I need to renew my license and the paper says call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:36:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It may be that the number on your paper has a different area code, and you dialed it as a local call. Do you see an area code on there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:37:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It says four-oh-one. That's mine. That's Rhode Island, isn't it? Why wouldn't that be the state?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:37:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is Rhode Island, you're right, the whole state is four-oh-one. But the city and the state have separate offices and separate lines. Same area code, different numbers after it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:37:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. So the area code doesn't tell you which office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:37:21-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, it only tells you the state. The Registry has its own phone line, and you can find it on the state's website or the back of your renewal notice. Do you have the notice in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:37:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have it. I'll look again. What days are they open? Are they open on the weekend? I can't be driving in this rain during the week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:37:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd have the Registry tell you their hours, I don't want to steer you wrong. And you mean weekday, not weekend, if you're asking about Monday through Friday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:37:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Weekday, yes. That's what I said. Whichever one is the work days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:37:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, yes, weekdays are the work days. Today's the rain, and it's supposed to keep going into tomorrow, so be careful out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:38:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. I'll call the number on the notice, then. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:38:07-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care now."
    }
  ],
